OL,3,GNEWSAAirport relies on #8 drop-off
OL,4,Afees, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airport boss said a government
OL,7,Freview into drop-off charges came at a
OL,8,Ftime when it was relying on revenue
OL,9,Fstreams to make it "a viable local
OL,10,Fairport".
OL,12,FThe Department for Transport is
OL,13,Fexpected to review charges after
OL,14,Fanalysis showed that prices at major UK
OL,15,Fairports had risen by a third on
OL,16,Faverage since the summer of 2025.
OL,18,FIn June, Norwich Airport increased its
OL,19,Fdrop-off charge from #6 to #8 for stays
OL,20,Fof up to 20 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
