OL,3,GNEWSAAirport relies on #8 drop-off
OL,4,Afees, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Pace said drop-off income was
OL,7,Fan important part of its revenue that
OL,8,Fhelped pay for airport operations,
OL,9,Fcomplying with regulation and long-term
OL,10,Finfrastructure.
